### AtlasEcho Users API Tests

### 1. Get User Profile & Travelogue
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/SOME_USER_ID

### 2. Follow / Unfollow User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/SOME_USER_ID/follow
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Get User Notifications ("Incoming Echoes")
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/notifications/all
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Fetch Weather for Coordinates
GET http://localhost:3000/api/weather?lat=45.9237&lng=6.8694
